{"id":"n21098-3-7","stage":0,"title":"분명하다 · 肯定","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n21098-3-7-1","ko":"민준이가 유민이에게만 선물을 주더라.","zh":"我看到敏俊只给了裕敏礼物。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준이가","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"민준이가","audio":"/audio/2d578794e58a65e57305.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이가","audio":"/audio/2d578794e58a65e57305.mp3"}},{"text":"유민이에게만","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"유민이에게만","audio":"/audio/013a813fb49b2349e5b9.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유민이에게만","audio":"/audio/013a813fb49b2349e5b9.mp3"}},{"text":"선물을","meaning":"礼物","explanation":"선물：礼物；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"선물","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36685","senseId":"1","lemma":"선물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선물을","audio":"/audio/9f3490a05172f0786ee4.mp3"}},{"text":"주더라.","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주더라","audio":"/audio/608611b6764fbc82fffb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"807cae1b57085769","term":"선물","zh":"礼物","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3","entryId":"36685","definition":"为表达谢意或祝贺某事而把东西送给别人；或指该东西。","pronunciation":["선ː물"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/dc3aafa6c4a2e028e897.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n21098-3-7-2","ko":"그래? 민준이가 유민이를 좋아하는 것이 분명해.","zh":"是吗？敏俊肯定喜欢裕敏。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"그래：真的","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"2","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"민준이가","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"민준이가","audio":"/audio/2d578794e58a65e57305.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이가","audio":"/audio/2d578794e58a65e57305.mp3"}},{"text":"유민이를","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"유민이를","audio":"/audio/6c3f3629ff63ff850fa3.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유민이를","audio":"/audio/6c3f3629ff63ff850fa3.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아하는","meaning":"喜欢","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아하는","audio":"/audio/2b4807c27825ce3100ef.mp3"}},{"text":"것이","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것이","audio":"/audio/466d343bd03b56aac534.mp3"}},{"text":"분명해.","meaning":"肯定，分明，明明白白","explanation":"분명하다：肯定，分明，明明白白；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"분명하다","audio":"/audio/f9798826d0d86c305d6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"21098","senseId":"3","lemma":"분명하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"분명해","audio":"/audio/a71a6a38056995818ca0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于对对方所说的话表示感叹或轻微的惊讶。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"对某事抱有好感。","pronunciat